<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mazel Stores started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mazel Stores started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Mazel Stores Inc with a buy.</p>
<p>-- said company has seasoned management team with stated goal of becoming $1 billion company in the near to medium term.</p>
<p>-- said industry is large enough to support another major wholesaler-retailer player.</p>
<p>-- Mazel gained 3/4 to 25-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
